* Date    : 2010 / 08 / 11                  
* Author  : Shih-Hsin Yeh
* Remark  : 1. Copy Igate model from L110E model.
*
* <Revision 5>                  
* Version : 0.3 P1                
* Date    : 2010 / 10 / 22                 
* Author  : Kelly Pao
* Remark  : 1. Removed the m in igate area formula.(area='w*0.9*l*0.9*m*1e4*tcig' --> area='w*0.9*l*0.9*1e4*tcig')
*
* <Revision 6>                  
* Version : 0.4 P1                 
* Date    : 2010 / 10 / 28                 
* Author  : Yealing Lin
* Remark  : 1. Add Twell NMOS model (copy from Twin well NMOS).
*           2. Modify Igate model:
*              (a) m=m to m=1
*              (b) area='w*0.9*l*0.9*1e4*tcig'to area='w*0.9*(l*0.9+1.2e-8)*1e4*tcig'
*              <c) 'rsh*nrd/m' to 'rsh*nrd'
*              <d) 'rsh*nrs/m' to 'rsh*nrd'    
* <Revision 7>                  
* Version : 0.5 P1                 
* Date    : 2010 / 12 / 24                 
* Author  : Shih-Hsin Yeh
* Remark  : 1. Recenter the model to align EDR target.
*           2. Revise Cgc parameters.
*
* <Revision 8>                  
